\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5710[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  saint Jehan Baptiste antifon.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Inter natos mulierum non surrexit maior Iohannes Baptista}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 6979}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Justus germinabit sicut lilium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 3549}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Oratio.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Perpetuus nos quesumus domine sancti Iohannis Baptiste tuere presidiis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et quando fragiliores sumus tanto magis necessariis attolle suffragiis. Per.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
