\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 15r-22v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Matutin}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :) (Anfang fehlt.) [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 noster. Nos autem populus eius et oues pascue eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Ps 94,7) ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aue Maria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .< >Q<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 uem terra, ponthus, ethera collunt, adorant, predicant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 AH 2, Nr. 27}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Ps 8, 18, 23. [Lectio prima:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ancta Maria, virgo virginum, mater et filia regis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedicta tu in mulieribus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 6244}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Lectio secunda.< >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ancta Maria, piarum piissima }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... >Responsorium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Beata es, virgo Maria, que dominum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [20v] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 portasti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 6163}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Lectio tercia.< >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ancta dei genitrix, que digne meruisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... >Responsorium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Felix namque es, sacra virgo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 6725}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ).{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ambrosi\-anus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Te deum lauda\-mus, te dominum confitemur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\~\endash \~...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >I<n te, domine, speraui, non non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 confundar in eternum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ora pro nobis, sancta dei genitrix, vt digni efficiamur promissione Cristi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .
