\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 60r-73r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bu\u223 \'dfpsalmen und Litanei}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (Anfang fehlt)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (60r-70r  Bu\u223 \'dfpsalmen:) (Anfang fehlt wegen Blattverlust) [... ocu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 lus meus inueteraui inter omnes inimicos meos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Ps 6,8-11, Ps 31, 37, 50, 101, 129, 142. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Antiphona}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ne reminiscaris, domine, delicta nostra .}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (CAO 3861). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Parce, domine, parce populo tuo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (CAO 4219).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 (70r-73r Litanei:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Letanie.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Kyri eleyson, Criste eleyson, kyri eleison}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , Criste, audi nos ...\~\endash \~...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Oratio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >F<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 idelium deus omnium conditor et redemptor ... ut indulgentiam, quam semper optauerunt, piis suppli\-cacionibus consequantur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Qui viuis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Rest von 73r und 73v leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. Textbeschreibung durch Erik Drigsdahl: http://manuscripts.org.uk/chd.dk/tutor/litanie.html. Vgl. Online-Editio\-nen: http://manuscripts.org.uk/chd.dk/tutor/lit135J9.html; http://medievalist.net/hourstxt/litanies.htm. \endash  Auf die {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6923/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Di\u246 \'f6zese Amiens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  verweisen die in der Litanei vorkommenden Heiligen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Firminus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Bischof von Amiens, s.\~o. Kalender) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Lucianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Lucian von Beauvais, Fest der \u220 \'dcbertragung der Gebeine am 16. Okt. in Amiens, Beauvais, Cambrai, Paris, Senlis und Soissons). Eng verwandte Litanei in: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Paris, BNF, lat. 13263, Bl. 113v-118v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

