\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [...] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quoniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (korr. aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quantum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nullum accidens recipiunt (sed in hoc differunt ab hiis, que sunt in dyalogis), sed diffiniciones. Augentur autem non per media, sed in postassumendo ...\~\endash \~... Sillogismus autem fit huius cause in media figura. Ut sit .a. animal, in quo .b. respirare, in quo .c. paries. In quo .b. omni in est .a. (omne enim respirans animal est), in .c. autem nullum, quare neque in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [...]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Aristoteles Latinus, IV.1-4: Analytica posteriora. Translationes Iacobi, Anonymi sive \lquote Iohannis\rquote , Ger\-ardi et Recensio Guillemi de Moerbeka, hg. v. Laurentius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Minio-Paluello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Bernardus G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Br\u252 \'fcgge / Paris 1968, S. 29,10-30,5, 30,16-31,13. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung (289 Hss.) vgl. ebd., S. XVI-XLIII.}

