\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 b.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 77rb-87vb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Der Mund als Tor des Schlosses, mit Abhandlung \u252 \'fcber die S\u252 \'fcnden der Zunge}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Wedder de twelften }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 dorheit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  so vechtestu willichliken vnde bewarest dat slot dines herten}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Men du scholt weten, dat vte desser slote ene dore geyt, de mostu by nod wol bewaren, dat is din mund, dar de tunge ene dore to is, vnde vor allen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [77va] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 doren vppe den sloten dar sint twe porteneres vore, de dat volk merken vnde in vnde vt laten. Also schol en portener stedes sytten vor dines mundes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 dor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 dat beschedenheit vnde vnsynnicheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?) ... (78va-87vb \u220 \'dcber die S\u252 \'fcnden der Zunge:)  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O leue mynsche, denke, heft got zele}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vnde lyf gheschapen van barmherticheyt, yd were wol recht, dat em en ynnich lytmate de tunghe reyne helde. Ok lat dy beweghen, dat diner tungen is ingheplantet ene berede neginghe to bosheyden, also sunte Jacob secht an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [78vb] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 syner epystolen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Iac 3,7-8): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alle naturen der dereken vnde vogele vnde der slanghen, de mach men wol temmen, vnde se bliuen wol tam by den luden, men de tunghe kan numment temmen, wente se is ene vruwe quat vnde dotliker vulnisse vnde vorgiftnisse\~...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (24 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 S\u252 \'fcnden der Zunge}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 beschempinge godes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 murmelent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vorvechtinge diner vndat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 mene swerent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 logene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 achtersprake\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vlesekent vnde ogelye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vlokent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 laster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 kyff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 11. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 bose rad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 12. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 twetracht maken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 13. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tweuoldige tungen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 14. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 leue tho nighen meren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 15. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 beromen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 16. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 openbaringe hemeliker dynk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 17. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vnbeschen drouwe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 18. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vnbeschen louede\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 19. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ydele wort\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 20. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vele sprekent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 21. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 schentlike sproke vnde laster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 22. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 loderye, de de lude to lachende beweget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 23. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vnbescheden swiget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 24. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 belachent anderen guden luden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \endash  (86va) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Wen du aldus gemerket heft}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de sunde der tungen vnde wlt de vlen, so scholtu vort merken, wo du dy an dinen worden bewaren scholt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >D<v scholt merken, datu vyf stucke scholt holden in dinen worden}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Tho dem ersten male, datu merken scholt, wat du sext vnde sprekest ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (87ra) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Wltu ok wene straffen myt worden}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , dar scholtu vere dink ane holden, dat du nicht en sundigest. Dat erste, datu nicht vnbescheden syst, also\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [87rb] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 datu nichten kundigest des mynschen ofte enes anderen laster ofte schande ...\~\endash \~... Dat vefte is wen dar lude to lude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 to vele sint edder tho weinich, dar dine straffin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [ge] [87vb] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 mer hindert wen se vromet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri-285\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Gh, Bl. 95vb-101rb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

