\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 a. Im Haupttext fehlende Lemmata, mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5710[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 niederdeutschen}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Interpretamenten}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Abbreuiacio: cortinghe. Abbatissa: abdische. Abieccio: wechwerpinge. Abintus: van bynnen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1rb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ab\-issus: afgrunde uel scindal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ablatus \endash ta, tum: wechgen\u248 \'f8men. Ablucio: waschinghe uel spulinghe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Abauus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 oueroldervader. Abolicio: afdoynghe. Abhominacio: misda\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 t uel vnbequeme. Abortiuus: dot\-boren. Absconsio: behudinghe. Abundancia: ouerulodich. Abusiuum dicitur vngeuuch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Angghel dicitur hamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (5rb). (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Armonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 suze tzuklank mit done\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (8rb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Atenuatus, -ta, -tum: vorschalet, vorsleten, vordunkert, vordunne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 t (9vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantica canticorum: dat bo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 k der gistliken leue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (14rb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominator: en weldich here, -trix: en weldich vrowe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (26rb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Edacitas: vrazicheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (27ra). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria, -rie: werkeldach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (33rb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Frons, frondes: louere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (34va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Gurgulium: spra\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 kadere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (37va). (gro\u223 \'dfe Zahl von nd. Glossen Bl. 41v und 42r:)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Inquisicio: vercriginghe ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 bis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Inuocacio: anropinge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Premium substantiale: gemeyne lon, solt, houetgu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 t. Premium accidentale: sunderlich lon, tzugift\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (58vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Processio: vorkomunghe, vzkunft, vzbrechen, vzgank\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (62vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Produccio: ewich vzbrengunghe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (63ra). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Blasphemare dicitur schemeliken vneren, schantfu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ren, schumpferen, schenden, honen, lasteren myt worden achter ru\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 gge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (90rb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Congratulamini: mede vrowet iuw\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (92va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ewangelizo, -as, -are, i. ewangelium pronunciare, vnde pau\-peres ewangelizantur. Dat ment, de armen in dem geste, de werden geropen to dem rike godes, dat hilge ewangelium en to kundeghende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (98va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Fatigo: ik mu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 de werde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (99ra). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Visito dicitur vanden uel heym suken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (112va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Absurdum: vngehort. Abusiue: vngeuochlik\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (112vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Competenter: beqwemeliken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (113va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Denique: to lesten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (113vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Penitus: altomale. Pene, fere, sensim, paulatim, vix, pedetemtim ... et dicitur teutonice byna efte vulna efte vppe na\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (115va). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Quemadmodum: likerwis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (116ra). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Quadrupli\-citer: veruoldelic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (115vb). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Vehementer dicitur vil zere, ut in psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Ps 103,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8218 \'82Benedic anima mea domino. Domine deus meus, magnificatus es vehementer\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (117vb).}

