\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 1va-vb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 Dominica tertia post Epiphaniam (Anfang).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Introitus:) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Adorate deum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB g00625}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Collecta.< Omnipotens semper deus, infirmitatem nostram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [1vb] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 propicius respice ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Lectio:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Ad Romanos.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Rm 12,16-21. (Graduale:) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Timebunt gentes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB g00626}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). (Evangelium:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Mattheum.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Mt 8,1-13 (nur Anfang).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Die Texte zu den beiden Sonntagen \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Missale Romanum, S. 62f.}

