\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prolog}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Q<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 uoniam, ut ait Ieronimus, nulli dubium est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quin totum ad gloriam laudis dei pertinet ... - ... Te genibus flexis et capite inclinato, te corde et ore saluto, salutansque dico: Aue Maria ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,}

