\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 46}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Teil I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De beata Maria}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De salutatione angelica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aue gracia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 1,28)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec salutacio est iocunda, quia de bono et per bonum nunciumuenit de celo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , portatur enim per angelum ... Nouem \u8218 \'82Gratia plena\u701 ?, quia habebat graciam ad deum, ad angelum, ad hominem contra diabolum ... - ... Item prefertur mulieribus, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam omnis mulier maledicta subiacet dei, qui dixit: In dolore paries \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Gn 3,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... quia sine dolore peperit et uirgo permansit, maledictum legis, quia filium habuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (s. u.).}

