\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 47}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Teil II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De peccatis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De poenitentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, quod sanctus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tria sunt, que spiritum sanctum expellunt a corde hominis: primum est duplicitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , secundum est obscuritas, tercium iniquitas ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 PL 206, Sp. 183D-184A}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , danach: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas Cisterciensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Algrinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentaria in Cantica canticorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , lib. III) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ..{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . nam assidue hanc uisitat precepto, aliquando flagello, aliquando miraculo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (hier {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zugeschrieben, aber wohl: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thomas de Aquino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Catena aurea in Lucam, cap. 19, lectio 5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

