\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 56}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item Collaciones pro recommendacione theologie. In nomine domini \u8230 \'85 Cuius thema est: Viam dei in veritate doces. In Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,16)].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In nomine domini dei nostri ps. 19}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In presenti actu tria occurrunt mihi facienda, primum diuinum auxilium inuocare, secundum sacram scripturam aliquantulum recommendare, tercium graciarum actiones vocetenus explicare. Quantum ad primum gloriosus doctor beatus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Crisostomus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in tractatu suo de anima infirma et frigida duo per uos aduertenda considerauit ... - ... cum omnimodo graciarum oblacione. Deinde regracior honorabili videlicet \u183 \'b7 N \u183 \'b7 huius alme uniuersitatis nostre rectori dignissimo etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest von 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 63}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: In Christi nomine amen. Cuius thema est: Bonus uisus est sermo. In Machabeorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (I Mcc 1,13)]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Christi nomine amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Doctor eximius beatus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicit: Ita libri termino reficitur lectoris intencio sicud labor uiatoris hospicio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Contra aduersarium legis et prophetarum, lib. 1] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Idcirco in presenti actu totali tria breuiter per me sunt fienda ordine tali: primo enim premittenda est auxilium diuini inuocacio, secundo subiungenda est sermonis diuini commendacio et tercio concludenda est per finali graciarum exclamacio. ... ad primum igitur reuoluenti mihi de sermones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diuini commendacione ... - ... ut per uictoriam perueniamus ad coronam, quod nobis concedere dignatur Ihesus Christus Marie filius ...  }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 3.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 71}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item in hoc actu etc. Cuius thema est: Uerbum reuelatum est Danieli. In Danielem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Dn 10,1)]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In hoc actu sunt tria per ordinem expediendo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , primo diuini nominis inuocacio facienda, secundo breuis collacio proponenda, tercio graciarum accio referendo. Quantum ad primum dicit Boetius tercio de consolacione prosa nona:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inuocandum, inquam, rerum omnium patrem, quo pretermisso nullum rite fundatur exordium. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Quantum ad secundum, scilicet ut pro recommendacione sacre theologie breuis collcio proponatur ... - ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ieronimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 epistolam ad Ephesos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hieronymus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Commentarii in IV epistulas Paulinas. Ad Ephesios, lib. 1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : tunc spiritum adopcionis accepimus, quando credidimus in filium dei, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto uiuit ... Amen.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 4.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 76}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: Recommendaturus sacrosanctam scripturam, cuius thema est: Uerbum salutis missum est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Apc 13,26)].\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >Alia recommendatio<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Recommendaturus sacrosanctam scripturam ipsam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , uidelicet theologiam a deo excelso scienciarum primordialiter exortam ... - ... uia, per quam uenitur ueritas, ad quam peruenitur, et uita in quam permanetur, ad quam uitam nos perducat deus, qui sine fine ... Amen.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 5.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 85}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: Laudare cupiens etc., cuius thema est: Excelsior celo est. In Iob \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Iob 11,8)]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur alia<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Laudare cupiens aliqualiter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut potero sacram scripturam in generali ac materiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 libri beati Job in speciali, scripturam, in qua lucis et splendoris scripturam gaudii et amoris, ... Presentem actum in tres distingwo partes. In primam mihi necessariam pro diuini auxilii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inuocacione, in secundam mihi difficile pro sacre scripture recommendacione, et in terciam mihi acceptabile proreferenda graciarum accione ... - ... ut ad gaudia celestia, quibus ipse firmiter peruenire valeamus, quod nobis dominus noster ... Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Diese Collatio auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Leipzig, UB, Ms 865}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. o. Vorbemerkungen), hier mit dem Vermerk: \u8222 \'84principium M. Ru\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ckeri [interlinear erg\u228 \'e4nzt: de Lutterburg] in cursus\ldblquote , zu Rutger Molitoris / Rucker von Lauterburg (1419 imm. Univ. Erfurt, 1419 imm. Univ. Leipzig, 1428 Mag. art., 1431 Bacc. sent. theol., 1432 Lic. theol. und Rektor, \u8224 \'86 1466) vgl. RAG: https://resource.database.rag-online.org/ngZP9Q072YH8kovNtASo3Xlw0ZC; eine \u8222 \'84Recommendatio sacrae scripturae\ldblquote  mit diesem Incipit au\u223 \'dferdem in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Oxford, BL, MS. Hamilton 44}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Sermones und Quaestiones an der Leipziger Universit\u228 \'e4t, 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 15. Jh., Vorbesitz: Kartause Erfurt), 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -105(a)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. https://medieval.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/catalog/manuscript_6007;}

