\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 6.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 91}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: Quatuor facies uni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Lex data est propter<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 thema\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quatuor facies uni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Ezechielis primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ez 1,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Secundum quod describit beatus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super Ezechielem, prima parte omelia tercia: Quia per faciem unusquisque congnoscitur, recte per faciem notitia designatur. Lex autem seu doctrina ewangelica licet sit una, quia ab unigenito filio data ... - ... in futuro per gloriam, qui est gracia conseruata, quod nobis concedat dominus noster Ihesus Christus ... Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zitat am Beginn wohl nach Nicolaus de Lyra: Postilla super totam bibliam, In Matthaeum, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB IV, Nr. 5896}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

