\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 8.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 98}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: Collacio de Assumpcione beate virginis. In Ierusalem potestas mea.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo in Assumpcione Marie<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In Ierusalem potestas mea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sir 24,15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Scribitur {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecclesiastes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  24 et legitur epistolariter in presentis festiuitatis misse officio. Uenerabiles patres et domini etc. Doctor gloriosus beatus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ieronimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  potestatem atque exaltacionem uirginis Marie exprimere pro sua possibilitate cupiens in quodam sermone presentis festiuitatis sic inquit: Maria uariis figuris est prefigurata ... - ... et in Ierusalem, in qua multiplex est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , korrigiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  potestas finaliter nos perducat, quod nobis prestare dignatur Ihesus Christus, Marie filius \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, und in der Sermones-DB verzeichnet. Diese Predigt auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Leipzig, UB, Ms 865}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. o. Vorbemerkungen); au\u223 \'dferdem weitgehend \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Uppsala, UB, C 197}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , hier 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , s. o. sowie Nr. 11 und 14;}

