\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [laut Inh.verzeichnis 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Collacio de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In presenti actu etc. Cuius thema est: Doctrina bona dabit graciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 13,15)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >I<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 n presenti actu tria per ordinem sunt efficienda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , primo diuini auxilii inuocacio est peragenda, secundo diuine sciencie recommendacio est proponenda, et tercio est graciarum accio referenda. Quantum ad primum itaque cogitante me de deitatis sublimitate, cuius unitatem racio probat mundus eloquitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Reuerendi magistri etc. Presens thema intencioni mee coaptare uelle uerum inter doctos veror loqui indoctus, inter eloquentes mutus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Quantum ad secundum uero pro recommendacione diuine sciencie occurrebat michi hoc thema: Doctrina bona dabit graciam, sic scribitur Prouerbiorum 13. Uenerabiles patres magistrique reuerendi ac domini honorandi. Quamqua omnis seu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doctrina sit bona secundum beatum {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernhardum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - ... in regno vocabitur superiorum. Ad quod omnes nos perducere dignetur Ihesus Christus Marie filius ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest von 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. }

