\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Conceptione Marie uirginis. >I<N{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  festo Conceptionis virginis gloriose matris Marie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quo peragitur eius in matris sue utero conceptio propositurus sermonem ... - ... omni deuocione eius festa recolamus etc.}

