\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 4}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo (?) in festo omnium animarum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Septem articulos de purgatorio)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur materia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  collecta, que possunt dici de animabus et nota eam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bene, quia pulcra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >P<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 elli mee consumptis carnibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Reposita est enim hec spes mea ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Iob 19,20 und 19,27).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quamqua illa verba dixit Iob de miseria sua plenus ulceribus iacens ... Ideoque adhuc sensum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  misticum de animabus fidelium hec uerba exponentur per aliquos articulos ... qui septem sunt, quorum primus sic sonat: Vtrum anime in purgatorio puniantur ... - ... eternaliter saluabitur, quod nobis concedat pater et filius ... Amen. }

