\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De summa felicitate et beatitudine sunt aliqua notanda:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Primo considerandum, quod sit beatitudo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... sicut doctores notant circa iiii sententiarum et presertim quidem doctor {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas de Argentina}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... in diem iudicii uident gloriam sanctorum.}

