\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 253}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentum in Ecclesiasten}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [Haupttext:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >U<erba {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecclesiastes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , filii David, regis Iherusalem.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Vanitas vanitatum, dixit Ecclesiastes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ; vanitas vanitatum, et omnia vanitas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 1,1f.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... siue bonum, siue malum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 12,14).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis ad e. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [eidem?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  operi.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Kommentar:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa inicium libri notandum: Subiectum siue materia illius libri est, quod hic agitur de contemptu mobilis affluencie sic, quod in istis transitoriis non est ponenda felicitas sed pocius in cognitione dei, qui est summum bonum et infinitum. ... - ... Notandum: hebrei habe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t pro \lquote omni erratu\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ecl 12,14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \lquote pro omni zelato\rquote  et sic textus clarior est ... id est zelato uel amato.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest von 266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ler.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, nachgewiesen.}

