\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >H<unc titulum more suo Ulpianus premittit quoddam prohemium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quo commendat edictum et ipsum edictum diuidit in tres partes et addit \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [D 8.2.31:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Si< testamento. Edificium subrogatum debet eandem seruitutem cum primo h. d. \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eandem seruitutem facit i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  c. l. cum debere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gegen\u252 \'fcber Druck erg\u228 \'e4nzt:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 columpnam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [bricht in Lex xxx ab, vgl. Druck (s. u.), Bildnr. 660]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Baldus de Perusio doctor utriusque iuris.
