\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 2.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 28-36) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hinc Augustinus dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O uita presens, que multos }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Druck: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 tantos}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  decipis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que dum fugis, nichil es, \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 aliis breuem ut in desperationem inducas. Hec ille.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
