\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 4.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 15 - 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 6) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Atque utinam mundi amatores illis omnibus, que mundi sunt salubriter neglectis, ad minus attenderent}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  seueritatem diuine iusticie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 24f.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... De quo quidem districto iudicio dicit Augustinus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Druck: Anselmus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O quam anguste erunt undique uie reproborum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 32f.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Item Iohannes Crisostomus: Nec resistendi uirtus erit nec fugiendi facultas ... - ... que reddatur eis de propitius. 
