\pard\sl254\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 5.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7 - 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3) [Schluss:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Timeant iam ut postea non timeant. Scriptum quippe est: In memoria eterna erit iustus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 111,7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ab illa vtique audicione mala ... - ... huius mundi amatoribus saltem aliquo modo describatur, quod de illis scriptum est in Horologio sapientie. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic puto esse annotandum: Attende, lector, ausculta cum omni diligencia, lege et relege ad cor tuum pone que secuntur in hoc uerba: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [s. u. Nr. 6: Auszug aus dem Horologium sapientiae].}

