\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 6.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<Actum est post hoc. Et ecce discipulus\~cepit\~cogitare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dies antiquos et annos eternos in mente habere. Cumque profunde se \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [interlinear erg\u228 \'e4nzt\~: re-]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 colligeret ... - ... Hoc solum facias, ut me a te in eternum separari non permittas. Hec in Horologio sapiencie. 
