\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 13.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 31 - 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hinc dicitur in horologio sapiencie: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lib. 1, cap. 12:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O quam misericorditer parcis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum hic aduersa tribuis \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 et tam immensam gloriam possidere decreuisti. Hec uide \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 supra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10-15) [\u220 \'dcberleitung:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut autem paterna correccio ... ostenditur, ubi sapiencia discipulum suum salubriter instruit, ita dicens: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 16 - 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 35) [lib. 1, cap. 13:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Audire uis cytharam spiritualis musice pulcre resonantem \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 quia mecum sunt sine fine regnaturi. Hec uide \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 supra. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 35 - 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 6) [lib. 1, cap. 13:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item dicit sapiencia in alio loco eiusdem libri: Tanta est preeminentia eterne glorie \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85 quia labor est cum fine premium sine fine. Hec uide \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 supra.
