ain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tract. [De profundis clamavi ad te,] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 domine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , domine exaudi uocem meam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB g00634}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Versus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fiant aures tue intendentes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB g00634a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc., Evang. Io 11,21-27, Off. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine Ihesu Christe, rex glorie, libera animas omnium fidelium defunctorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB g01573}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Off.verse {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hostias et preces tibi, domine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [laudis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  offerimus, tu suscipe pro animabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) illis quarum hodie memoriam agimus ... ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB g01573a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Redemptor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [marum omnium]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  christianorum, mitte archangelum sanctum Mychaelem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C-DB g01573c}}\plain \f1\lang103