\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >F<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 uit in diebus Herodis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Lc 1,5).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Istud est ewangelium beati Luce ewangeliste}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quo ewangelista primo pretendit describere conceptum precursoris domini saluatoris mirabilem fuisse ex tribus, primo ex parentum condicione, secundo ex angelica anunciacione, ibi: Factum est autem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 1,8)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , tercio ex patris incredubili punicione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In mense autem sexto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 1,26).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Descripto conceptu precursoris consequenter describitur conceptus saluatoris. In mense autem sexto: scilicet a concepcione Iohannis missus est angelus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exurgens autem Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 1,39).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ista est secunda pars principalis prime partis, in qua descripto conceptu utriusque tam saluatoris quam precursoris describitur utriusque ortus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >F<actum est autem in diebus illis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum secundum, in quo descriptum ortum saluatoris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen und marginal erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  precursoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  describitur ortus siue natiuitas saluatoris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 etc., 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [eingef\u252 \'fcgte Schaltzettel mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen des Schreibers sowie Exzerpten:]}

