\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exzerpte zum Thema Maria / Vita activa et contemplativa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De prerogatiua benediccionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Marie: Sermo de Assumpcione: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedicta tu in mulieribus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Lc 1,28)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , id est plus quam omnes mulieres}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Super \u8218 \'82Missus est\u701 ?: Ecce si vir, id est Adam, cecidit in peccatum per feminam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De humilitate et sanctitate beate uirginis. Bernardus super \u8218 \'82Missus est\u701 ?: Que est hec uirgo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tam]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  venerabilis ut salutetur ab angelo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem: Felix Maria, cui nec humilitas defuit, nec uirginitas. ... Idem\~super \lquote Missus est\rquote : Ad uirginem angelus missus est: uirginem carne, uirginem mente, uirginem professione, ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Moralia: Marthe cura non reprehenditur, Marie uero deuocio laudatur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 - ... De summo bono: Actiua uita mundanis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rebus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bene utitur, contemplatiua uita mundo renuncians, soli deo uiuere delectatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest von 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Exzerpte u. a. aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Homiliae super 'Missus est'}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , hom. 1, pars 5 et 9. ho, 2, pars 3, vgl. Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq/Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.) Bernardi opera, vol. 4 (1966), S. 17, 20, 23; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Moralia in Iob}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , lib. 6, pars 37; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , lib. 3, cap. 15, sent. 2, vgl. CCSL 111, S. 241.}

