\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kommentar zu Lc 2,22 (Purificatio) und Lc 1,59 (Circumcisio)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postquam impleti sunt dies purgationis Marie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum legem Moysi ... eius circumcisionis debet duci ad templum domini et effari pro eo hostiam secundum legem Moysi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Postquam impleti sunt ... secundum legem, id est in quadragesima die post natiuitatem Christi, tulerunt illum, id est Ihesum, scilicet Maria et Joseph a Bethleem, ubi natus est ... - ... Ysaia 48: Dedi te \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [in]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lucem gentium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Is 49,6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et gloriam plebis tue Israel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Lc 2,32), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est Iudeorum.}

