\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 superbia mater est et caput}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omnium uitiorum.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ab ea enim inanis gloria descendit, inuidia, ira, tristitia, auaritia, uoluntas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lies: uoluptas]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  carnis, in qua continetur gula atque luxuria. ... - ... qua expulsa per graciam efficitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Druck: efficimur]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  templum dei et habitaculum spiritus sancti etc. Hec Augustinus in sermone sexto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad fratres in heremo.
