\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod sit presciencia et quomodo differat a predestinacione. Ait Hugo de sa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cramentis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , li. 2\u176 \'b0, parte 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , c. 12: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus non predestinauit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nisi quod facturus presciuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De presciencia demonum ait Augustinus super Genesim, li. 3\u176 \'b0 in fine: Demones aliqua futura contingecia scire permittuntur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Signa predestinationis sunt hec: Si libenter audis uerbum dei ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Euidentissimum signum reproborum superbia est, at contra humilitas electorum: Gregorius in Moralia li. xxxiiii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (lib. 34, pars 23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 wohl wiederverwendetes Blatt, am unteren Rand von 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  kopfst\u228 \'e4ndig \u228 \'e4ltere Eintr\u228 \'e4ge: Eink\u252 \'fcnfte eines Plebans: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item plebanus recepit a domino Barghardo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  x mr. Item de sancte Jacop iiii marc. Item de beate virgine benedictus iiii marc, vi f. minus.}

