\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 De\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conceptione uirginis Marie. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<Ignum magnum apparuit in celo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Apc 12,1).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Bernardus: Uehementer nobis, dilectissimi, uir unus et mulier una nocuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sed dei gracia per unum nichilominus uirum et mulierem unam omnia restaurantur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem Bernardus: Si rerum pretia de raritate pensamus, nichil de hiis rarius poterit inueniri. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Hic Bernardus\~: Defectus omnis sub Maria est, quicquid enim fragilitatis siue corrupcionis est, excellentissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quadam sublimitate exedit ... - ... secundus defectus consistit in boni difficultate a primo tamquam riuus a fonte staturiens. De istis ceteris de sanctibus vide in Succo de sanctis in sermone uno de Assumpcione uirginis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl252\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa165\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium I, S. 448, Nr. 109. Teilweise \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bernardus Claraevallensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Sermones de sanctis, Dominica infra octavam Assumptionis BMV (De duodecim praerogativis B. V. Mariae), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 PL 183, Sp. 429C-438C}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

