\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 7.-12.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcberschriften: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item feria secunda, lectio prima, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 bis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (die):]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ordo preposterus, sed necessario commutatus. Si enim primum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [posuisset]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abraham et postea Dauid, rursus ei repetendus fuerat Abraham, ... - ...\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum uero legis preceptum Hely efficitur filius, cuius Iacob, quia frater erat, vxorem ad suscitandum fratri semen acceperat. Et per hoc rata inuenitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atque integra generatio, bricht ab], 
