\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentum in Cantica canticorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit tractatus super Cantica canticorum<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Prolog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >O<sculetur me osculo sui etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ct 1,1).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Salomon inspiratus diuino spiritu cum posuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hunc librum de nupciis Christi et ecclesie ... - ... liber iste, quia nulle ibi memorantur persone, et quasi enim communi stilo compositus est.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Text\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Osculetur me osculo oris sui etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ct 1,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Vox est synagoge desiderantis aduentum Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quasi dicente: Tociens promisit mihi aduentum suum per prophetas. Veniat ergo iam et osculetur me osculo oris sui, id est: per se ipsum loquatur mihi ... - ... Fuge, dilecte mi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ct 8,14)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et impleto incarnacionis et passionis tue misterio reuertere ad celum ... Et hoc est, quod dominus dicit in ewangelio. Et sic est finis huius libri super Cantica canticorum. Deo laus et gloria per infinita seculorum secula. Amen. >Explicit tractatulus compendiosus super Cantica canticorum. Deo gracias< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [darunter Zeilenf\u252 \'fcllsel]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Spalte sowie Bl. 241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 VI, Nr. 10096}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , danach anonymer Kommentar, nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Oxford, Bodleian Library, SC 2300 (Bodl. 550) (XII; Reading, OSB)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 101-118.}

