\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 329\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Soliloquium de quattuor mentalibus exercitiis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (De imagine vitae)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (329\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Prolog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit prologus primus in librum Boneventure \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cardinalis, qui intitulatur Dyalogus Boneventure vel meditaciones Boneventure vel ydea contemplacionis vel ymago vite<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >F<lecto genua mea ad patrem domini nostri Ihesu Christi ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eph 3,14-19)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . >Alius prologus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<aulus apostolus dei, uas eterne eleccionis, sacrarium diuine sancti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (329}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vb}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ficacionis, speculum et exemplar superne contemplacionis, in uerbis premissis ostendit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nobis ... - ... ad eum, qui est omnis desiderii finis et complementum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Text\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De prima meditacione, que debet esse de consideracione eorum, qui sunt de interiori cognicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hominis. Capitulum primum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<nima dicit: Dic, queso, o homo, si post deuotam inuocacionem diuine megnificencie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... donec tecum sim mansurus in celesti gloria. Qui viuis et regnas deus per omnia secula seculorum amen. Et sic est finis huius libri qui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [vom Schreiber marginal erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dyalogus Boneuenture cardinalis uel Meditaciones Boneuenture cardinalis uel Ydea contemplacionis uel Ymago vite. Deo laus et gloria. >Explicit liber Boneventure cardinalis<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest von 370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

