\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Register}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >I<Ncipit registrum Ordinarii. De officio prime tonsure: folio v\u176 \'b0. ... - ... De letania dicenda: folio Cix. De letania in uigilia pasche ad fontem et in consecracione ecclesiarum cantanda: folio Cxi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest von 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Mit Verweisen auf die wohl vom Schreiber eingef\u252 \'fcgte zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssische Foliierung. Die Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge auf 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  nicht ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rubrica de celebrandis ordinibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hic sequuntur rubrica licet scripta de celebrandis ordinibus. In nomine domini. Amen. Hec rubrica siue ordo est qualiter et quo tempore episcopi debent facere ordines secundum consuetudinem Romane curie<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<rimo sciendum est, quod nullus episcopus debet facere ordines extra dyocesam suam nisi de licencia ipsius dyocesani uel domini pape}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et nullus potest recipere ordines nisi a proprio episcopo uel de licencia sua ... Cardinales possunt presentare suos clericos familiares ... - ... Completa missa et omnibus ordinate sicut inferius continetur peractis et completis benediccione accepta recedant. In nomine domini.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Postquam omnes ordinandi per archidyaconum sunt uocati, dicat episcopus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >P<rohibemus sub pena excommunicacionis ne quis recipiat ordines, qui sit in peccato mortali, uel qui sit de aliena dyocesui sine dimisso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 riis proprii episcopi, nec seruus sine licencia sui domini ... - ... et restituimus ecclesie et ecclesiasticis sacramentis. In nomine patris et filii ... Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ein Text mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Incipit (Et primo sciendum est, quod nullus episcopus potest facere ordines ...) in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Toulouse, Biblioth\u232 \'e8que municipale, Cod. 67}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (14. Jh.), 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Le pontifical de la Curie Romaine au XIIIe si\u232 \'e8cle [s. u.], S. 212.}

