\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pontificale, pars I}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Es gibt \u220 \'dcbereinstimmungen mit dem r\u246 \'f6misch-deutschen Pontifikale (um 950-64) sowie mit r\u246 \'f6mischen Pontifikalien des 12. und 13. Jh.s, vgl. die Ausgaben: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 PRG = Cyrille \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vogel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Reinhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Elze\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Le pontifical romano-germanique du dixi\u232 \'e8me si\u232 \'e8cle, Bd. 1-2: Le texte (Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana: Studi e testi 226, 227), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1963/1966, Bd. 3: Introduction g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale et tables (Studi e testi 269), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1972. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 PR = Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Le Pontifical Romain au moyen-\u226 \'e2ge, tome 1: Le pontifical Romain du XIIe si\u232 \'e8cle (Studi e testi 86), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1938.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 PRC\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 = Pontificale romanae curiae = Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Andrieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Le Pontifical Romain au moyen-\u226 \'e2ge, tome II: Le pontifical de la Curie Romaine au XIIIe si\u232 \'e8cle (Studi e testi 87), Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1940.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Folgenden nur stichprobenartiger Abgleich mit diesen Ausgaben, eine genauere liturgiewissenschaftliche Einordnung steht noch aus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Teilweise \u252 \'fcber mehrere Seiten reichende rubrizierte Rubriken mit ausf\u252 \'fchrlichen Handlungsanweisungen und Angaben zum liturgischen Ger\u228 \'e4t, das f\u252 \'fcr die einzelnen Handlungen vorbereitet werden soll (z. B. 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zur Kirchweihe). In den Rubriken Erw\u228 \'e4hnung von Kanonikern, wohl einer Dom- oder Stiftskirche (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 superiores canonici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), mehrerer Kantoren (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), der Schola bzw. des Chores (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) sowie von Knaben, die einen Gesang anstimmen (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Bei den Weiheformularen, die Pluralformen f\u252 \'fcr die zu Weihenden vorsehen, interlinear alternative Endungen in Rot f\u252 \'fcr Singularformen eingetragen, z. B. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 pro hiis famulis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , durch interlineare Eintr\u228 \'e4ge erg\u228 \'e4nzt zu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 pro hoc famulo suo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  u. \u246 \'f6.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Auff\u228 \'e4llige Schreibformen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 qui Habrae beato patriarche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 aperto hostio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >A<d honorem omnipotentis dei incipit liber, qui appellatur Ordinarium. Et primo de ordinibus celebrandis. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio primae tonsurae / Ad clericum faciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Cum episcopus dat clericis primam tonsuram genua sua flectant coram eo et episcopus dicat stando sine mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >O<Remus, dilectissimi fratres, dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum pro hiis famulis suis, qui ad deponendam comam capitis sui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG III.1; PRC I.1), (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) PRG III.2-6; PRC I.2-5, (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Post hec archidyaconus uel dyaconus capa indutus stans in medio chori sic uocet communiter ordinandos<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<d titulum inteme\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rate uirginis Marie Warmiensis ecclesie hostiarii, exorziste, acoliti, subdiaconi, dyaconi, presbiteri ordinandi procedant. >Quibus circa episcopum ordinate per gyrum omnibus locatis archidiaconus dicat ad episcopum<: >P<ostulat hec sancta ecclesia, reuerende pater, hos uiros ordinibus aptos consecrari sibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (PRG XV.2-4), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Et tunc episcopus dicat hec<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<uxiliante domino deo et saluatore nostro Ihesu Christo eligimus hos uiros ordinibus aptos consecrandos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u228 \'e4hnlich PRG XVI.1), (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Et statim incipiatur letania \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio hostiariorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hostiarii cum ordinantur, postquam ab archidyacono instructi fuerint, qualiter in domo domini debeant couersari ... tradet eis episcopus cla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ues cum fune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XV.9, dort: claves ecclesiae de altari; PRC V.2), (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) eingeschaltet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >H<Ostiarium oportet percutere cymbalum, aperire ecclesiam et sacrarium et librum aperire ei, qui predicat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XIV.1; PRC V.1), (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) PRG XV.10-11: PRC V.3-4, (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Postea dicat episcopus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >N<unc habetis ordinem hostiariorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio lectoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >M<odo recipietis ordinem lectoratus. >De officio lectoris hoc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [episcopus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sedendo cum mitra dicat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >L<Ectorem oportet legere ea, que predicat, et lecciones cantare et benedicere panem et omnis fructus nouos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XIV.2; PRC VI.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Lectores cum ordinantur, tradet eis episcopus codicem, de quo lecturi sunt adtangendum et dicat episcopus sedendo cum mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<ccipite et estote uerbi dei relatores ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XV.14; PRC VI.3), (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Pronunciacio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >E<ligunt uos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres uestri, ut sitis lectores in domo dei nostri ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XV.13; PRC VI.3) (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) PRG XV.15-16; PRC VI.5-6, (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >N<unc habetis ordinem lectoratus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio exorcistarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >M<odo recipietis ordinem exorcistatus. >De officio exorciste hoc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [episcopus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sedendo dicat cum mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<xorcistam oportet abicere demones et dicere populo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui non conmunicat, ut det locum, et aquam in ministerio fundere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XIV.3; PRC VII.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Exorcista cum ordinatur, accipiat de manu episcopi sendentis libellum, in quo scripti sunt exorcissmi ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<ccipite et commendate memorie et habetote potestatem imponendi manus super energuminos siue baptizatos siue catecuminos. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (PRC VII.2-4);\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio acolythorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De officio acoliti episcopus hoc dicat sedendo cum mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<colitum oportet ceroferarium ferre et luminaria accendere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC VIII.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Acoliti cum ordinantur, accipiant de manu episcopi sendentis cum mitra ceroferarium cum cereo extincto dicente episcopo ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<ccipite ceroferarium cum cereo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (PRC VIII.2-6);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio subdiaconorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >De officio subdyaconi. Primo legat archidyaconus: Ad tytulum intemerate et gloriose uirginis Marie Warmiensis ecclesie subdyaconi ordinandi procedant. >Quo lecto uocet eos nominatim ut benedicantur ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<ubdyaconum oportet preparare aquam et uuinm}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ministracione altaris et ministrare dyacono. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC IX.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Postea legat archidyaconus hoc capitulum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >S<icut qui inuitatus rennuit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quesitus refugit sacris est altaribus admouendus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 138, Sp. 1004B-C: Capitula s. Gregorii papae),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hic accipiant de manu episcopi stantis patenam et calicem uacuum, et dicat episcopus ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >U<idete, cuius ministerium uobis traditur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (PRC IX.3-7);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio diaconorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De officio dyaconi primo legat archidiaconus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<d tytulum intemerate et gloriose uirginis Marie Warmiensis ecclesie dyaconi et presbiteri ordinandi procedant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . >Quibus uocatis legat archidiaconus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >P<ostulat hec sancta ecclesia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (s. o. 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Et tunc archidyaconus legat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<d titulum intemerate et gloriose uirginis Marie Warmiensis ecclesie dyaconi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [marginal erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordinandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  procedant. >Quo lecto uocet eos nominatim, ut benedicantur, quibus uocatis dicat episcopus sedendo cum mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >D<yaconi oportet ministrare ad altare et baptizare et predicare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC X.2), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Tunc legat archidiaconus hoc capitulum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Q<uando dyacones ordinantur, oportet eos professionem episcopo suo facere, ut cas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 te et pure uiuant sub timore dei ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Decretum Gratiani pars I, dist. 28, canon 3 et 7),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Dyaconus cum ordinatur solus episcopus, qui eum benedicit, manus super caput eius ponat ... et dicat episcopus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >C<ommune uotum communis oracio prosequatur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC X.5-11) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio presbyterorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur ordinacio presbiteri<. Et primo legat archidiaconus: >A<d titulum intemerate et gloriose uirginis Marie Warmiensis ecclesie presbiteri ordinandi procedant. >Et uocet eos nominatim. Quibus uocatis compareant coram episcopo, et tunc statim redeant ad medium chori, et quilibet ducatur inter duos presbiteros ad episcopum. Et dicat episcopus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est dignus? >Respondentes illi duo sacedotes et dicant<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dignus est. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. PRC X.15), etc.;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Responsorien und Antiphonen mit Notation: 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  >Qua finita incipiat episcopus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Veni, sancte spiritus >et chorus prosequatur. Quo finito, incipiat episcopus antiphona<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Accipite spiritum >et chorus prosequatur< ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  >Hic incipiat episcopus responsorium<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Sunt lumbi uestri pre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [cincti] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >et chorus prosequatur responsorium<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Uox tonitrui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  etc.,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  beim Gebet \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >O<mnipotens, sempiterne deus, tocius origo bonitatis et fons omnium graciarum, puri>+<ficare, bene>+<dicere et conse>+<crare digneris hos famulos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  marginaler Eintrag einer j\u252 \'fcngeren Hand (15. Jh., 2. Viertel): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Hec oracio non habetur in aliis pontificalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nachtrag am unteren Blattrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Collecta pro ordinandis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >E<xaudi, quesumus, domine, supplicum preces et deuoto tibi pectore famulantes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (vgl. Pontificale G. Durandus, XII.2, hier bei Ordinatio diaconi).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Benediccio lapidis primarii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo fiat crux in ipso lapide cum ferro aliquo et postea benedicatur in hunc modum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus, in adiutorium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<mnipotens sempiterne deus, qui filium tuum lapidem angularem et petram immobilem ... nominari uoluisti, sancti>+<ficare et bene>+<dicere digneris lapidem istum primarium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRC XXIII.15) etc., (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Alia oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : PRG CXC.1 (Benedictio domus), (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine deus, qui licet celo et terra non capiaris, domum tamen tibi in terra fieri uoluisti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XXXVI.3: De aedificanda ecclesia) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 de fundacione noue ecclesie\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ad fundamentum noue ecclesie xii lapilli rotundi silicis in noua scultella cum xii granis thuris et quatuor laminis plumbeis, in quibus nomina ewangelistarum sculpantur et ponantur coram fundatore. Postmodum incipiat fundator antiphona<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ueni, sancte spiritus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  die ersten beiden Orationes gek\u252 \'fcrzt zitiert, etc., (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine sancte, pater omnipotens, eterne deus, fundator creaturarum, bene>+<dicere dignare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hos lapides uel hec ligna septiformis gracie tuo dono ad construendum templum nouum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (PRG --; PRC --), (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [deus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui licet celo et terra non capiaris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XXXVI.3, s. o. 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [nicht im Register] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Benediccio poliandri uel cimiterii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine, sancte pater, omnipotens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eterne deus, locorum omni sanctificator et reformator in melius, a quo et per quem omnis benediccio de celis descendit in terras, bene>+<dicere dignare istum locum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRC XXIV) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Reconciliacio cimiterii uiolati\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo ueniens episcopus extrinsecus retro chorum ad orientem ... et dicatur letania, in cuius fine surgens episcopus dicat ter<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut cimiterium istud bene>+<dicere et reconcili>+<are digneris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad consecrandum cimiterium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fiant quinque cruces locande, quatuor in quatuor plagis, scilicet ad orientem, ad occidentem, ad austrum, ad aquilonem, et quinta in medio retro chorum ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc., (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Letania, Benedictio salis et aquae etc., (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Modo episcopus ... legat stando sine mitra hanc oracionem<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<eus, qui es tocius orbis conditor et humane generis redemptor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (PRG LIV.2) etc., (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Hac collecta finita episcopus crucem in manum accipiens incipiat hanc antiphonam<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >S<ignum salutis pone, domine Ihesu Christe, in loco isto ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (mit Notation, PRG XXXVI.2) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad consecrandum ecclesiam\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo erunt preparata in ecclesia quecumque necessaria, videlicet una noua urna plena cum aqua, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que tegatur cum noua tela ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tunc episcopus circu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eat ipsam ecclesiam de foris cum clero et populo, incipiens a sinistra parte spergendo aquam benedictam ad fundamentum forinsecus et scola cantet Resp.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >F<undata est domus domini super uerticem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Notation, vgl. C-DB 6756), (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Orationen und Ges\u228 \'e4nge vgl. PRG XL.13-21, z. T. mit gegen\u252 \'fcber dem PRG zus\u228 \'e4tzlichen Ges\u228 \'e4ngen, z. B. (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Resp. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >T<u, domine uniuersorum, qui nullam habes indigenciam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Notation, vgl. C-DB 5199), (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Z<achee, festinans descende, quia hodie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (mit Notation, vgl. C-DB 5515), (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Verweis auf Litanei, (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beschriftung des Bodens mit griechischem und lateinischen Alphabet durch den Bischof (vgl. PRG XL.25-26), in den Text griechisches (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und lateinisches Alphabet (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) eingef\u252 \'fcgt, etc. bis (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Et tunc episcopus ... faciat sermonem ad populum, post quem intimet populo, in cuius honore sit ecclesia dedicata ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Missa in consecratione ecclesiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Deinde reuertatur pontifex in sacrarium, ubi deposito pluuiali induatur pontificalibus ... qua facta incipiatur introitus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Intr.  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >T<erribilis est locus iste ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Notation, C-DB g01401), (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Oratio: PRG XLII.1, Grad. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >L<ocus iste a deo factus est ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit Notation, C-DB g01402) etc. bis Postcomm. PRG XLII.4;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad consecracionem magni altaris\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Episcopus indutus sua camisia, scandalibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen und am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt durch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 amictu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , alba, stola et capa corali cum mitra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sine manipulo veniens ante altare consecrandum incipiat ibi et dicat septem psalmos cum ministris suis. ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Finita letania subiungat hanc collectam immediate sine mitra<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<cciones nostras, quesumus, domine, aspirando preueni ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC Appendix IV.3) etc.; Hymnus mit Notation: 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Post hoc incipiat alta uoce<: Veni creator spiritus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (AH 50, Nr. 144) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >et cantetur totus ympnus ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 benediccio lapidis itinerarii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (liturg. Rubrik am Rand nachgetragen:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Episcopus indutus amictu, alba, s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tola]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et cappa ... et habeat baculum past\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 oris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prefacio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adiutorium nostrum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<Eum patrem omnipotentem, fratres dilectissime, uotis exultantibus deprecemur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. PRC XXVII.1), (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item alia benediccio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >E<xaudi nos, deus salutaris noster, et precum nostras ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PRC XXVII.2) etc.; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo reconciliationis ecclesie uiolate et cimiterii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum quosdam. Primum ueniat episcopus cum baculo pastorali ornatus pontificali ...veniens episcopus ante maius hostium ecclesie deposita mitra dicat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<remus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >O<mnipotens sempiterne deus, qui sacerdotibus tuis pre ceteris tantam graciam contulisti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (vgl PRC XXVI.1-9), u. a. Antiphonen mit Notation: 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >A<sperges me, domine, ysopo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C-DB 1494), 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >E<xurgat deus et dissipentur inimici eius ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo ad signum ecclesie, id est ad campanam benedicendam\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Episcopus indutus pontificalibus pluuialibus ... uadat ad campanam benedicendam dicat in uia hos septem psalmos ueniales<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miserere mei, deus ... >Quibus dictis duo legant letaniam simplicem< ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Benedictio aquae, salis et oleo]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >B<ene>+<dic, domine, hanc aquam benediccione celesti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (vgl. PRC XXV.1-11);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 benediccio uestium sacerdotalium et omnium ordinum sequencium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et primo benediccio casule, planete, dalmatice, stole, manipule et aliarum uestium sacerdotum et leuitarum, oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >O<mnipotens sempiterne deus, qui per Moysen famulum tuum pontificalia seu sacerdotalia ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PRC XXXIII.1-2); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Benediccio lintheamium altaris, oracio\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine deus omnipotens, qui ab inicio hominibus utilia et necessaria ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (vgl. PRC XXIII.75-76),
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  marginaler Verweis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Benedicciones ad corp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [ora]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 lia quere in signo tali folio secundo sequenti: \u183 \'b7 \u248 \'f8 \u183 \'b7 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (vgl. 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 );
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Consecracio patene\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >C<onsecra>+<mus et sancti>+<ficamus hanc \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  patenam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. (vgl. PRC XXVIII.1-3);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Prephacio calicis consecrandi\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<remus, dilectissime fratres, ut deus et dominus noster ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Consecracio calicis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<ignare, domine, calicem istum bene>+<dicere ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , etc. (vgl. PRC XXIX.1-4);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Benediccio corporalium\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >O<remus: Clementissime domine, cuius inenarrabilis uirtus ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. PRC XXX.1-2);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Benediccio uasculi eucharistialis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quo corpus domini reconditur<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<remus, fratres dilectissimi, ut dominus omnipotens hoc uasculum corporis filii sui ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >O<mnipotens sempiterne deus, trinitas ineparabilis, manibus nostris ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC --, vgl. PR XXIII.1-2);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo in die Cene\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo ad reconciliandum penitentes. Episcopus indutus melioribus pontificalibus suis ... et superiores canonici sui cum cappis eiusdem coloris, ministri uero cum tunicellis eiusdem coloris ... et archidiaconus stans coram eo legat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >A<dest, uenerabilis pontifex, tempus acceptum, dies propiciacionis diuine ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRC --, vgl. PR XXXA.4) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De officio missae in die Coenae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Quibus omnibus peractis uadat episcopus ad sacrarium et induat casulam ... Et interim cantores misse incipiant officium<: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Intr. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >N<os autem gloriari oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (C-DB g00180) etc., 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Praefatio und Hochgebet mit Notation, 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Te-igitur-Initiale nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt, 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  im Canon missae beim Gedenken an die Verstorbenen: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 memento, domine,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [marginal erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 famulorum famularumque tuarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] ...;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De consecratione olei infirmorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Tunc offeratur ampulla cum oleo infirmorum et ponatur a dextris super altare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orationem dicat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >E<xorzizo te, immundissime spiritus omnisque incursio Sathane ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >E<mitte, domine, spiritum tuum paraclitum de celis in hanc pinguendinem olyue, quam de uiridi ligno producere dignatus es ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. PR XXXA.38f., PRC XLII.12-13) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Einzelne Ges\u228 \'e4nge notiert, z. B. 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Pater noster, 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Hymnus ad Chrisma consecrandum:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  >Tunc tres pueri incipiunt cantare hunc ympnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >A<udi, iudex mortuorum / una spes mortalium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. AH 51, Nr. 77 (Rest von Str. 1 sowie Refrain des \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Chorus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >O< redemptor, sume carmen ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  von der \u252 \'fcblichen NH erg\u228 \'e4nzt). Zahlreiche marginale Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (liturgische Anweisungen und zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Gebete) von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden (16. und evtl. 17. Jh.), z. B. 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 abluat digitos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , am unteren Blattrand notierter Gesang: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Oleum infirmorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Prestas nobis, per ip+sum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , bei mehreren Gebeten (z. B. 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) marginaler Eintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 vacat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De consecratione sancti crismatis:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur oracio super balsamo<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 olei chrismali mixtum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >O<Remus dominum nostrum omnipotentem, qui incomprehensibilem unigeniti filii sui sibique coeterni diuinitatem mirabili dispositione uere humanitati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (PR XXXA.50) etc. (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Deinde antequam benedicatur halet ter super ipsam ampullam et dicat lenta uoce exorcismus crismalis olei incipiendo<: >Exorzizo te creatura olei per deum patrem omnipotentem, qui fecit celum et terram ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PR XXXA.52) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zahlreiche marginale Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (liturgische Anweisungen und zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Gebete) von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden (16. und evtl. 17. Jh.), z. B. 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 astantes singuli successiue eodem modo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 filio suo, qui cum eo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Communio: Dominus Ihesus postquam cenauit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 De consecratione olei cathechumenorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Et tunc statim offeratur episcopo altera ampulla cum oleo cathecuminorum et ponatur super altare ante episcopum. Tunc episcopus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [korr.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 h\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alet in ipsam ter sicut in priorem<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Exorzizo te, creatura olei in nomine dei pa>+<tris omnipotentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (PR XXXA.57) etc.; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo ad consignandum pueros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus in adiutorium ... >O<mnipotens sempiterne deus, qui regenerare dignatus es hos fideles \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [interlinear: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >hunc famulum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex aqua et spiritu sancto ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 etc. (vgl. PRC XXVIV.2-6);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Litania dicenda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ohne Notation), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit Lethania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >K<yrieleison\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >S<aluator mun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 di. Adiuua nos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , u. a. (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Benedikt, Bernhard, Dominikus, Franziskus;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  doppelt verzeichnete Anrufung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >A<b omni malo, libera nos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  radiert, auf 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  am oberen Seitenrand vom Schreiber Anrufung nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >P<er crucem et passionem tuam, libera nos ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [von NH] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Et finitur liber ordinarius<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Rest von 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Litania cantanda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (mit Notation), u. a. (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Benedikt, Bernhard, Dominikus, Franziskus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
