\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber ordinarius f\u252 \'fcr bestimmte Weihehandlungen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Verzeichnis der im Pontifikale verwendeten Ges\u228 \'e4nge, ohne Notation.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Offizium zur Weihe der Geistlichen: Off. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<legerunt apostoli Stephanum leuitam plenum fide et spiritu sancto}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C-DB g00563) etc., mit Ausschnitt aus Sequenz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >I<nfunde / vnctionem tuam / clemens nostris sensibus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 53, Nr. 70: Sancti spiritus assit nobis gratia ..., Str. 7-11);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hec cantentur in consecracione cimiterii<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Signum salutis pone, domine Ihesu Christe, in loco isto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: in domibus istis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (C-DB 206526) etc., am unteren Blattrand nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sancta Maria, succurre miseris, iuua pusillanimes ... intercede pro deuoto femineo sexu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C-DB 4703);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hec cantentur in consecracione ecclesie<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >F<undata est domus domini super uerticem moncium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C-DB 6756) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hec agentur in consecracione altaris<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Sequenz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >U<eni creator, spiritus, / mentes tuorum uisita ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 50, Nr. 144);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hec eciam dicitur in consecracione itinerarii seu uiatici ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<sperges me, domine, ysopo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (C-DB 1494) etc.;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad campanam benedicendam septem psalmos penitenciales<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >M<iserere mei, deus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , secundum ... >quere supra ii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  psalmus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 f. Cxxii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 etc. bis (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Psalmus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >E<xultate, iusti, in domino; rectos decet collaudatio. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 32). Rest von 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

