\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 In ordinacione abbatisse\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopus debet missam cantare et eam benedicere hoc modo: Post antiphonam ad introitum et datam oracionem et reliquum officium misse usque ad ewangelium prosternat se electa ante altare retro episcopum cum duabus uel tribus sororibus. Erantque ibi letanie cum precibus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut hanc electam nostram abbatissam benedicere digneris ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oremus<: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<oncede, quesumus, omnipotens deus affectui nostro tue miserationis effectum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et famulam tuam \u183 \'b7N\u183 \'b7, quam ad regimen tuarum eligimus famularum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. PRG XXXII.1-4, 6, 5 etc., (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcbergabe der Regel:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Tunc det ei regulam dicens: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe regulam a sanctis patribus nobis traditam ad regendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  custodien\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dumque gregem tibi a deo creditum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XXXII.9f.; PRC XVII.19), (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcbergabe des Rings:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Tunc det ei anulum dicens<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe anulum discrecionis et honoris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut sis fidei integritate ante omnia munita ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG LXIII.45, hier: Accipe anulum pontificalis honoris, ut sis ...), (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcbergabe des \u196 \'c4btissinnenstabs:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Deinde dei ei baculum dicens<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe baculum sacri regiminis signum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG LXIII.42), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item sequitur alia oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<oncede, quesumus, omnipotens deus, famule tue abbatisse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut ostendendo et exercendo, que recta sunt,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (PRG --) etc. bis (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<eus, cui omnis potestas et diginitas famulatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , da famule tue \u183 \'b7 N. \u183 \'b7 prosperum sue dignitatis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XXVI.14), Resp. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Regnum mundi<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [et omnem ornatum ...] (C-DB 7524);}

