\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo ad consecracionem dominarum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sanctimoniales uirgines cum ad consecracionem episcopi sui offeruntur in talibus uestibus applicentur, qualibus semper utuntur sanctimonie et professioni aptis. ...<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PRC XVIII.1 etc., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >... tunc proce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dant ille que consecrande sunt ante altare in ecclesia coram episcopo, cum clero cantante<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >Q<ue est ista que progreditur quasi aurora}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Ges\u228 \'e4nge auf 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  mit Notation und Angaben zum Vortrag, z. B.: (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Chorus respondeat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Ista est speciosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >Deinde episcopus cantet<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 >U<enite, uenite, uenite, filie ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Weihe von Schleier und Krone:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Tunc offerantur uelamina \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [vom Schreiber erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et corone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ante altare episcopo ad benedicendam ...< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 PRC XVIII.3-5,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcbergabe des Schleiers:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Benediccione expleta episcopus imponat uelamen super caput ipsarum uirginum ita dicens<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe uelum sacrum, puella}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod perferas sine macula ante tribulan domini nostri ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XX.16; PR XII.25f.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Tunc ipsa uelata incipiat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >I<nduit me dominus >ceteris que circumstant prosequentibus ...< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XX.17-18), (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\u220 \'dcbergabe der Krone:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad coronam imponendam<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe signum Christi in capite, ut uxor eius efficiaris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XX.24; PR XII.33) etc., [\u220 \'dcbergabe des Rings\~:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad dandum anulum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ccipe anulum fidei, signaculum spiritus sancti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PRG XX.23; PR XII.32) etc. bis (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... >Deinde faciat episcopus sermonem exhortacionis et publica uoce bannum episcopalem imponat, ne quis eas a diuino seruicio sub uexillo castitatis impediat, ut bona sua cum quiete possidenat. Quo facto episcopus comittat eas abbatisse sub hac uoce ita dicens<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uide quomodo istas deo sacratas representes inmaculatas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ante tribunal domini nostri Ihesu Christi. >Sequitur prefacio ... Finita missa uelate inponant Te deum laudamus, populus acclamante Kyrieleyson.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Ordo ad consecrandas monachas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Consecrande monache accedant ad dominum episcopum et coram eo ueniam petant et interrogate ab eo, quid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lies: petant]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  respondeant: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<eto misericordiam dei omnipotentis et sancte Marie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  perpetue uirginis et sancti Benedicti abbatis et nostri et istius sancti conuentus, ut me monacham faciatis. >Quibus dominus episcopus respondeat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ueras monachas facere dignetur uos dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ..., (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >Sequitur letania<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >K<yrieleison. >X<peleison etc. usque ibi: ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , u. a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >U<t famulas tuas religionis monastice habitum petentes conseruare digneris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hic surgentes ab oracione accedant singule ad altare et legant tytulum professionis sue dicentes<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<go soror \u183 \'b7N\u183 \'b7 promitto stabilitatem et conuersacionem morum meorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et obedienciam secundum regulam sancti Benedicti abbatis coram deo et sanctis eius in hoc monasterio, quod est constructum in honore sancte dei genitricis Marie sanctique \u183 \'b7N\u183 \'b7 in presencia domini \u183 \'b7N\u183 \'b7 episcopi et spiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alis patris mei et matris mei. >Hoc postquam singule legerint ter super genua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inclinantes hunc uersum dicunt<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<uscipe me, domine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Orationes: PRC XVII.2-5,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... >Hic surgant ab oracione et dominus episcopus aspergat eas aqua benedicta et cucullas ita benedicat. Oracio<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<eus, bonarum uirtutum dator, et omnium benediccionum largus infusor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (PRG XX.7, hier: Domine deus, bonarum ...; PRC XVIII.4), (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... >Deinde cucullam imponens unicuique dicat ad singulas<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >E<xuat te dominus ueterem hominem cum actibus suis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et induat te dominus nouum hominem, quo secundum deum creatus est ... >Hiis ita peractis \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 cantrix\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  incipiat<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Regnum mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  marginaler Eintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic finitur officium monacha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et statim fiat sermo. Quo fini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [to]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sequitur offertorium et finita missa ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 In den liturgischen Rubriken sowohl der Gesang des Klerus und des cantors (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) als auch der cantrix (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) erw\u228 \'e4hnt. }

