\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ieronimus de Melchisedech littera personat hec quis sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >M<isisti mihi volumen anonino (!) \u951 ?\u7936 ?\u948 d\u8051 ?\u963 s\u960 p\u959 ?\u964 t\u959 ?\u957 ? et nescio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , utrum tu de titulo nomen subtraxeris an ille, qui scripsit, ut periculum fugeret disputandi, auctorem noluerit confiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . ... - ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut, quod exercitacione lingue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 profuit, nocuerit corporis valetudini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
