\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio de s. Birgitta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur oracio bona de sancta Birgitta<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  sancta Birgitta, mater pia, vas gracie rosaque mundicie ... Tu namque, que ex nobili regum Gothorum prosapia prodisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in hac hora uespertina uelut stella fulgens ... Tu es electa filia altissimi dei patris, sponsa noua filii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Tu es latrix littere summi imperatoris ... Tu es illa, cui Christus saluator nouam regulam communam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 instituit modo admirabili reuelauit, que mulieris apostolicis regula \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  -m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancti saluatoris nuncupatur. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nata est Birgero filia, cuius vox admirabilis per mundum vniuersum audietur ... - ... ut post hanc vitam miseram eternam valeamus possidere leticiam. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Das Gebet bei Manuscripta Mediaevalia, In principio etc. nicht nachgewiesen. Am Beginn \u220 \'dcbereinstimmungen mit der Sequenz zum Birgittenfest (AH 37, Nr. 152): \u8222 \'84Surgit mundi / vergente vespere / ... / Birgitta, vas gratiae / rosaque munditiae / ...\ldblquote  (Str. 1a). Weiterhin biographische Bez\u252 \'fcge und textliche Anlehnungen an die Vita S. Birgittae auctore Birgero archiepiscopo Upsalensi (BHL 1335), vgl. AASS 1. Oct. IV, Dies 8, Sp. 486C-D: \u8222 \'84Nata est Birgero filia, cujus vox audietur per mundum futurum ...\rdblquote .}

