\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2}}\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super septem psalmos poenitentiales}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (am Beginn unvollst.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [Bl. 1 mit Textbeginn fehlt, s. o. Kodikologie].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Domine, ne in furore ..., Beginn fehlt: ... vidit David] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 angelum interficientem populum ita turbatus fuit, quod cecidit super genua in terram dicens ad dominum: Ego sum, qui pectaui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am unteren Blattrand vom Schreiber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sensus propheticus iam sequitur<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] (Z. 39-42) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Consequenter ad sensum propheticum accendendo est sciendum, quod tota intencio psalmiste est in isto psalmo peccatores prouocare ad penitenciam et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad implorandam dominicam misericordiam ante mortem. ... - ... ibi muta erunt pre verecundia et erubescencia maiori, ampliori et eterna. Et sic patet psalmus primus psalmorum penitencialium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur secundus psalmus<. >B<Eati, quorum remisse sunt ... Iste psalmus est secundus inter penitentiales. Et fundatur super historia, que habetur \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 2. Regum 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= II Sm 12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vbi dicitur, quod, postquam Dauid commisit peccatum adulterii cum Berzabee et homicidii Vrie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 misit dominus Nathan prophetam ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Beati, quorum remisse sunt ... Iuxta sensum propheticum est sciendum, quod sicud propheta in psalmos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 precedenti induxit penitentes ad dominice misericordie imploracionem, sic in isto intendit eosdem inducere ad firmam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Wort gestrichen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spei tentionem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 - ... hic semper habeamus gaudium in spe donec habeamus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 37\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tercius psalmus. >Psalmus tercius<. >D<omine, ne in furore ... Hic psalmus tercius est inter pe- \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 penitenciales. Et de materia huius dicunt doctores, quod Dauid eum fecit ad retardacionem peccatorum suorum notabilium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >Sensus propheticus<. >D<omine, ne in furore ... Ad intellectum propheticum procedendum est, sciendum quod intencio prophetico in hoc psalmo est inducere penytentes ad preteriorum peccatorum frequentem meditacionem ... - ... Bene ergo penitens dominum petit dicens: Intende in adiutorium meum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 37,23);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 50\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur. >M<iserere mei, deus ... Iste psalmus sicud precedentes duplicem habet intellectum, scilicet litteralem et propheticum. Sensus litteralis fundatur super hystoria, que iam in duobus psalmis est tacta. Et habetur \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 2. Regum 12\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= II Sm 12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vbi dicitur, quod, postquam Dauid commiserat peccatum adulterii cum Berzabee uxorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Wort am Ende korrigiert]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vrie ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sensus propheticus<. Miserere mei ... Iuxta sensum et intellectum propheticum est sciendum, quod sicud propheta in psalmo precedenti intendebat penitentes inducere ad peccatorum suorum frequentem recordacionem ... sic in isto psalmo intendit eos inducere ad peccatorum suorum dolorosam et lacrimosam contriciuonem et confessionem ... - ... ad perfectionem deducta, super omnia vero iusticia consumata. Quam etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 101\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur psalmus quintus. >D<omine, exaudi orationem meam ... Iste psalmus ut ceteri duplicem habet intellectum, scilicet litteralem et misticum. Quo ad primum intellectum est sciendum, quod secundum beatum Augustinum Dauid fecit hunc psalmum et omnes alios ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >D<omine, exaudi orationem meam ... Iuxta sensum et intellectum propheticum et moralem est sciendum, quod sicud psalmus in psalmo precedenti intendebat inducere penitentes ad ueram cordis contricionem ... sic intencio in hoc psalmo est eosdem inducere ad deuotam oracionem ... - ... nec morte nec vita, nec presentibus nec futuris separari possint a caritate hic in vita et gloria eterna. Et ideo bene dicitur: Et semen eorum in seculum dirigetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ps 101,29) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 129\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur. >D<e profundis clamaui ... De materia huius psalmi, quam ad litteram dicunt aliqui, quod est oracio ipsius Dauid, quam fecit supplicando a deo veniam de peccato adulterii ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... >D<e profundis clamaui ... Secundum sensum propheticum et misticum propheta intendit in hoc psalmus penitentes inducere ad satisfaccionem, sed in precedenti ad deuotum oracionem ... - ... Ideo et de istis redemptionibus predictis hic dicit propheta: Et ipse redimet Israel ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 129,8).;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps 142\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur. >D<omine, exaudi oracionem meam ... Istum psalmum fecit propheta et rex Dauid in tribulacione sua, qua fuit, quando eum persequebatur Absolon filius eius ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >D<omine, exaudi oracionem meam ... Iuxta sensum propheticum est sciendum., quod intencio est prophete penitentes inducere ad referendum graciarum acciones ... - ... Unde apostolus ad Galatas: Cum essemus paruuli, sub elementis huius mundi eramus seruientes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gal 4,3-7).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cuius hereditatem nobis vtinam bonis seruis et filiis concedat Ihesus Christus, qui eternaliter vnicus filius cum deo patre et spiritu sancto viuit et regnat deus. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) rot gerahmtes Schreiberkolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber presens, scriptus et completus anno etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 42\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 52 et hoc in die beati Dominici \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [05.08.1452]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hora vesperorum per me Johannem etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Darunter, ebenfalls rot gerahmt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedictus sit deus pater omnipotens in secula seculorum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Der Text \u252 \'fcber die Anf\u228 \'e4nge der Abschnitte zu den einzelnen Bu\u223 \'dfpsalmen sowie das Explicit nicht zu identifizieren bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, sowie in den Datenbanken (In principio, Manuscripta Mediaevalia, Patrologia latina, LLT etc.).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 M\u246 \'f6glicherweise ist diese Lectura unikal \u252 \'fcberliefert und entstand im Kontext des (L\u252 \'fcbecker?) Ordensstudiums. Zu einer Entstehung des Textes im Kontext des Dominikanerordens w\u252 \'fcrde die Beobachtung passen, dass die eigens abgesetzten Abschnitte zum \u8222 \'84sensus propheticus\ldblquote  (vgl. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) ein Stufenmodell zur Unterweisung der \u8222 \'84peccatores\ldblquote , wohl im Kontext der Beichte, entwerfen und somit vielleicht f\u252 \'fcr die Predigt oder die seelsorgerliche Unterweisung der Gl\u228 \'e4ubigen verwendet werden konnten: (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 6): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 peccatores prouocare ad penitenciam et ad implorandam dominicam misericordiam ante mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 31): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 eosdem inducere ad firmam spei tentionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 37): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inducere penytentes ad preteriorum peccatorum frequentem meditacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 50): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 eos inducere ad peccatorum suorum dolorosam et lacrimosam contricionem et confessionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 101): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 eosdem inducere ad deuotam oracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 129):\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  penitentes inducere ad satisfaccionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  zu Ps 142):\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  penitentes inducere ad referendum graciarum acciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

