\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Der Schreiber (der Haupthand, s. o. Kodikologie) imitiert an einigen Stellen die griechischen Buchstaben auf Latein, z. B.: 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Explicit von liber V): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Quero te, queror\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [Ed.: quaero] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 a te. Alia toyto oy aetoice i i N oy poala ioi to N poB Naa aNdoN H tipoB e ia\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 N \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 c ai e HxoNtec toN Di RoN apie aloN\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . [Ed.: \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ?\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8016 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u941 \'dd\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u7989 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u929 \'d1\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ?\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ' \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u7970 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ? \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ' \plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs20 \u