\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs22 Ner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 ei, Achillei et Pancratii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 (12.05.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Oratio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 S<emper nos, domine, martirum tuorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Nerei, Achillei] (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 atque Pancracii, quesumus, foueat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Lectiones\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >D<omitilla neptis Domiciani desponsata Aureliano filo consularis ... >A<urelianus impetrauit a Domiciano, ut, si sacrificare nollet ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lect. OP 48.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >P<ancracius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nobilissimus iuuenis, parentibus mortuis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lect. OP 48.2) etc.;
