\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs22 Nico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 medis m.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 (01.06.?)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , nur Kurzverweis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >D<eus, qui nos beati Nicodemis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [f\u252 \'fcr Nicomedis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : require Ignatii in uigilia Purificacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (01.02.);
