\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs22 Primi et Feli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 ciani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 (09.06.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >F<ac nos, quesumus, domine, sanctorum tuorum Primi\u8203 ? et Feliciani deuota tuente semper festa sectari ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Lectiones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >T<emporibus Dyocleciani et Maximiani Primis et Felicianus accusati apud eos a pontificibus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lect. OP 54.1), (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >S<equenti die iussit Primum adduci et dixit ei: Ecce, frater tuus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lect. OP 54.2), (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >P<ost hec iussit eos in theatrum simul duci et duoa leones ad eos immitti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Lect. OP 54.3);
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 Barnabe apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 (11.06.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >F<ac nos, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [quaesumus, domine, intervenien]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 te beato Barn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [aba ...], Lectiones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >S<anctus Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [nabas, Cyprus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  genere, unu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [s de septuaginta]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  duobus Christi d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [iscipulis ... Textverlust] etc. bis (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >C<um ergo inde exissent uenerunt in Salaminam ciuitatem et cepit apostolus synagogam Iudeorum per ewangelium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sancti Mathei ad Christi graciam introducere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (\u228 \'e4hnlich Lect. OP 55.6), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >C<ognito autem, quod Eu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [sebius vir magnus ..., bricht ab]. }

